            <history xml:id="history_id64a8d0fb">
               <p xml:id="idm111">The autograph for this work was contained in the manuscript for "Studier og Novelletter", but Hartmann expressly stated that he wanted the piece and "Andante Cantabile" (HartW 111) copied into a separate album. This never happened, but instead the pieces were published in "Musikblade udgivne af Foreningen Fremtiden.".</p>
